      "message": "This doesn\u0027t make sense.  First, a single master key can be used with multiple encryption modes. A different key is derived for each mode or for each file.  So there\u0027s not necessarily only one derived key size.  Second, the comment refers to mk_iv_ino_lblk_64_tfms, but that is not used for inline encryption keys.",
